About Batas Hire and Purchase	We're on a mission to make financial services more accessible...	22 Years of Growth in Financial Services	{"root": {"type": "root", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Founded with the vision of democratizing financial services, Batas Hire and Purchase has emerged as a trusted partner for individuals and businesses seeking flexible financing solutions. Our NBFC license ensures regulatory compliance while our technology first approach delivers unmatched customer experience.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "We understand that every customer's financial journey is unique. That's why we've built our platform to offer personalized solutions, whether you're looking to purchase your dream vehicle or need flexible payment options for your purchases.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "With our AI powered assessment system and streamlined processes, we've reduced approval times from weeks to minutes, making financial assistance available when you need it most.,da", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}], "direction": null}}	50,000+	Happy Customers	₹500 Cr+	Loans Disbursed	99.2%	Customer Satisfaction	15+	Banking Partners	Our Mission	To democratize financial services by providing accessible, transparent, and innovative financing solutions that empower individuals and businesses to achieve their goals.	Our Vision	To democratize financial services by providing