 accessible, transparent, and innovative financing solutions that empower individuals and businesses to achieve their goals.	Our Values	Transparency, integrity, customer-centricity, and innovation guide everything we do. We believe in building lasting relationships based on trust and mutual success.	Board of Directors	Experienced leadership guiding our strategic vision	Leadership Team	Meet our executive team driving operational excellence	22 Years of Growth	Our journey from inception to industry leadership	What Our Customers Say	Don't just take our word for it. Hear from thousands of satisfied customers across India.	Regulatory Compliance	Batas Hire and Purchase operates under the regulatory oversight of the NRB as a licensed Non Banking Financial Company (NBFC).We maintain the highest standards of compliance, data security, and customer protection in all our operations.	RBI Licensed NBFC	ISO 27001 Certified	PCI DSS Compliant	\N	\N	\N	252	en	223	Our Financial Solutions	Tailored financing options to meet your diverse needs with transparent terms and competitive rates	How It Works	Get approved and funded in just 4 simple steps...	Ready to Get Started?	Join thousands of satisfied customers who have chosen our hassle-free financing solutions.	Start Your Application	/contact	Calculate Your EMI	/calculator	Build Your Future With Us	Join our dynamic team and be part of Nepal's leading financial services company	Current Openings	Join our team of open positions	Why Join Batas?	Discover what makes us a great place to work	Learn More About Our Culture	/culture	Life at Batas	Why our employees love working with us	Our Final Solutions	\N	What Our Customers Say	\N	Latest News & Updates	\N	Knowledge Center	Stay informed with expert insights, financial tips, and industry trends	Need More Help?	Can't find what you're looking for? Our support team is here to help.	Contact Support	Schedule a Call	Get In Touch	Have questions about our financial services? We're here to help you 24/7 with