About Batas Hire and Purchase	We're on a mission to make financial services more accessible...	22 Years of Growth in Financial Services	{"root": {"type": "root", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Founded with the vision of democratizing financial services, Batas Hire and Purchase has emerged as a trusted partner for individuals and businesses seeking flexible financing solutions. Our NBFC license ensures regulatory compliance while our technology first approach delivers unmatched customer experience.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "We understand that every customer's financial journey is unique. That's why we've built our platform to offer personalized solutions, whether you're looking to purchase your dream vehicle or need flexible payment options for your purchases.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "With our AI powered assessment system and streamlined processes, we've reduced approval times from weeks to minutes, making financial assistance available when you need it most.,da", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}], "direction": null}}	50,000+	Happy Customers	₹500 Cr+	Loans Disbursed	99.2%	Customer Satisfaction	15+	Banking Partners	Our Mission	To democratize financial services by providing accessible, transparent, and innovative financing solutions that empower individuals and businesses to achieve their goals.	Our Vision	To democratize financial services by providing accessible, transparent, and innovative financing solutions that empower individuals and businesses to achieve their goals.	Our Values	Transparency, integrity, customer-centricity, and innovation guide everything we do. We believe in building lasting relationships based on trust and mutual success.	Board of Directors	Experienced leadership guiding our strategic vision	Leadership Team	Meet our executive team driving operational excellence	22 Years of Growth	Our journey from inception to industry leadership	What Our Customers Say	Don't just take our word for it. Hear from thousands of satisfied customers across India.	Regulatory Compliance	Batas Hire and Purchase operates under the regulatory oversight of the NRB as a licensed Non Banking Financial Company (NBFC).We maintain the highest standards of compliance, data security, and customer protection in all our operations.	RBI Licensed NBFC	ISO 27001 Certified	PCI DSS Compliant	\N	\N	\N	1284	en	282	Our Financial Solutions	Tailored financing options to meet your diverse needs with transparent terms and competitive rates	How It Works	Get approved and funded in just 4 simple steps...	Ready to Get Started?	Join thousands of satisfied customers who have chosen our hassle-free financing solutions.	Start Your Application	/contact	Calculate Your EMI	/calculator	Build Your Future With Us	Join our dynamic team and be part of Nepal's leading financial services company	Current Openings	Join our team of open positions	Why Join Batas?	Discover what makes us a great place to work	Learn More About Our Culture	/culture	Life at Batas	Why our employees love working with us	Our Final Solutions	\N	What Our Customers Say	\N	Latest News & Updates	\N	Knowledge Center	Stay informed with expert insights, financial tips, and industry trends	Need More Help?	Can't find what you're looking for? Our support team is here to help.	Contact Support	Schedule a Call	Get In Touch	Have questions about our financial services? We're here to help you 24/7 with personalized support.	Send Us a Message	Business Hours	24/7 Customer Support Available	NBFC Licensed	Secure & Trusted	4.9/5	Smart Finance	Made Simple	Instant BNPL solutions and vehicle financing with transparent terms...	Your Financial Journey Simplified	Discover our comprehensive financial services...	Quick Tools	Get instant calculations and valuations	Trusted by Thousands	Our numbers speak for themselves - building trust through consistent service and reliability	Licensed & Certified	Your security and trust are our top priorities	Frequently Asked Questions	Find answers to common questions about our services. Can't find what you're looking for? Our support team is here to help.	Still have questions?	Our customer support team is available 24/7 to assist you with any questions or concerns.	Chat with Support	Call 1800-123-4567	Legal & Compliance	Transparency and compliance are at the heart of our operations	Regulatory Information	Our licenses and certifications	Legal Documents	Access our policies and legal documentation	Important Notices
बतास भाडा र खरिदको बारेमा	हामी वित्तीय सेवाहरूलाई अझ सुलभ बनाउने लक्ष्यमा छौं...	वित्तीय सेवामा २२ वर्षको वृद्धि	{"root": {"type": "root", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "वित्तीय सेवाहरूलाई सबैको पहुँचमा पुर्याउने (democratize) दृष्टिकोणका साथ स्थापित बतास हायर एण्ड पर्चेज, लचिलो वित्तीय समाधान खोजिरहेका व्यक्ति र व्यवसायहरूका लागि एक विश्वसनीय साझेदारको रूपमा उभिएको छ।", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}], "direction": null}}	५०,०००+	शुभ ग्राहकहरु	₹५०० करोड+	ऋण वितरण गरियो	९९.२%	ग्राहक सन्तुष्टि	१५+	बैंकिङ साझेदारहरू	हाम्रो मिशन	व्यक्ति र व्यवसायहरूलाई आफ्ना लक्ष्यहरू प्राप्त गर्न सशक्त बनाउने पहुँचयोग्य, पारदर्शी र नवीन वित्तीय समाधानहरू प्रदान गरेर वित्तीय सेवाहरूलाई प्रजातान्त्रिक बनाउन।	हाम्रो भिजन	पारदर्शिता, निष्ठा, ग्राहक-केन्द्रितता, र नवीनताले हामीले गर्ने हरेक कामलाई मार्गदर्शन गर्दछ। हामी विश्वास र पारस्परिक सफलतामा आधारित दिगो सम्बन्ध निर्माणमा विश्वास गर्छौं।	हाम्रा मानहरू	पारदर्शिता, निष्ठा, ग्राहक-केन्द्रितता, र नवीनताले हामीले गर्ने हरेक कामलाई मार्गदर्शन गर्दछ। हामी विश्वास र पारस्परिक सफलतामा आधारित दिगो सम्बन्ध निर्माणमा विश्वास गर्छौं।	सञ्चालक समिति	हाम्रो रणनीतिक दृष्टिकोणलाई मार्गनिर्देशन गर्ने अनुभवी नेतृत्व	नेतृत्व टोली	सञ्चालन उत्कृष्टता प्रदान गर्ने हाम्रो कार्यकारी टोलीसँग भेट्नुहोस्	विकासको २२ वर्ष	स्थापनादेखि उद्योगको नेतृत्वसम्मको हाम्रो यात्रा	हाम्रा ग्राहकहरू के भन्छन्	हाम्रो कुरामा मात्र विश्वास नगर्नुहोस्। देशभरिका हजारौं सन्तुष्ट ग्राहकहरूबाट सुन्नुहोस्।	नियामक अनुपालन	बतास हायर एण्ड पर्चेज नेपाल राष्ट्र बैंक (NRB) को नियामक निरीक्षण अन्तर्गत एक इजाजतपत्र प्राप्त गैर-बैंकिङ वित्तीय कम्पनी (NBFC) को रूपमा सञ्चालन हुन्छ। हामी हाम्रा सबै कार्यहरूमा अनुपालन, डाटा सुरक्षा र ग्राहक संरक्षणको उच्चतम मापदण्डहरू कायम राख्छौं।	NRB बाट इजाजतपत्र प्राप्त NBFC	ISO 27001 प्रमाणित	PCI DSS अनुपालन	\N	\N	\N	1285	ne	282	Our Financial So